history, contract potential, and urgency. Hot leads (scored 80+) are routed instantly to the
nearest commercial sales rep with a notification and full lead dossier. Warm leads (50-79) enter
an automated nurture sequence. Cold leads (below 50) receive a polite automated response
with self-service resources.
